msgid "PES transformations"
msgstr "势能面变换"

msgid ""
"Once a potential energy surface (PES) has been generated by the ``XSURF`` "
"program, it can be transformed to different representations. The first "
"possibility (`analytical representations (POLY) "
"<pes_transformations.html#analytical-representations-poly>`__) is a "
"representation by basis functions, i.e. the ``POLY`` program. The "
"``PESTRANS`` program (`transformation of the coordinate system (PESTRANS) "
"<pes_transformations.html#transformation-of-the-coordinate-system-"
"pestrans>`__) offers a transformation of the PES for vibrational structure "
"calculations of isotopologues or Franck-Condon factors."
msgstr ""
"一旦势能面（PES）由 ``XSURF`` 程序生成，它可以被变换为不同的表示形式。第一种可能性（\\ `解析表示（POLY） "
"<pes_transformations.html#analytical-representations-poly>`__\\ "
"）是通过基函数进行表示，即 ``POLY`` 程序。\\ ``PESTRANS`` 程序（\\ `坐标系变换（PESTRANS） "
"<pes_transformations.html#transformation-of-the-coordinate-system-"
"pestrans>`__\\ ）提供了对势能面的变换，用于同位素体或弗兰克-康登因子的振动结构计算。"

msgid "Analytical representations (POLY)"
msgstr "解析表示（POLY）"

msgid ""
"The ``POLY`` program allows for the transformation of the potential energy "
"surface and property surfaces from a grid representation to an analytical "
"representation by polynomials, Gaussians or B-splines. <!--Once the PES "
"calculation has been started from a transition state, this must be specified"
" explictly by the ``SADDLE`` keyword.-->"
msgstr ""
"``POLY`` 程序允许将势能面和性质曲面从网格表示转换为通过多项式、高斯函数或B样条表示的解析表示。<!–一旦势能面计算从过渡态开始，必须通过 "
"``SADDLE`` 关键字明确指定。–>"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "Record handling"
msgstr "记录处理"

msgid ""
"The ``DISK`` directive allows to specify explicitly, from where the grid "
"information shall be taken and where it shall be stored to disk. This can "
"also be accomplished in an automated manner, which is recommended. These "
"features are only relevant for the simulation of vibronic spectra as one has"
" to deal with several PESs in the same input. For simple VCI calculations, "
"no information is needed here."
msgstr ""
"``DISK`` "
"指令允许明确指定从何处读取网格信息以及将其存储到磁盘的何处。这也可以通过自动方式完成，推荐使用自动方式。这些功能仅与模拟振动光谱相关，因为需要在同一输入中处理多个势能面。对于简单的"
" VCI 计算，此处不需要任何信息。"

msgid "Fit Functions"
msgstr "拟合函数"

msgid ""
"A fit function has to be defined for each coordinate. These fit functions "
"are used to transform an grid representation of a surface generated by the "
"``XSURF`` program to an analytical representation. If no fit functions are "
"given, the fit functions used in the ``XSURF`` program for the intermediate "
"fitting are used. This directive also exists in the ``XSURF`` program. If no"
" fit functions are defined within the ``XSURF`` program, but in the ``POLY``"
" program, the fit functions of the ``POLY`` program are also used in the "
"``XSURF`` program."
msgstr ""
"必须为每个坐标定义一个拟合函数。这些拟合函数用于将由 ``XSURF`` 程序生成的势能面的网格表示转换为解析表示。如果未给出拟合函数，则使用 "
"``XSURF`` 程序中用于中间拟合的拟合函数。该指令也存在于 ``XSURF`` 程序中。如果在 ``XSURF`` 程序内未定义拟合函数，但在 "
"``POLY`` 程序中定义了，则 ``POLY`` 程序的拟合函数也会在 ``XSURF`` 程序中使用。"

msgid "Scaling factors"
msgstr "标度因子"

msgid ""
"The 1D potential functions can be scaled by user-defined factors. This "
"allows to fit potentials to experimentally determined frequencies."
msgstr "一维势函数可以通过用户定义的因子进行标度。这允许将势函数拟合到实验确定的频率。"

msgid "The following example shows the scaling of the three modes of water."
msgstr "以下示例展示了水的三个模式的标度。"

msgid "Internal Coordinates"
msgstr "内坐标"

msgid "Transformation of the coordinate system (PESTRANS)"
msgstr "坐标系变换 (PESTRANS)"

msgid ""
"The ``PESTRANS`` program allows to change the coordinate system being used "
"within the representation of the potential by a Duschinsky-like "
"transformation. This allows for the transformation of PESs as needed for the"
" calculation of the vibrational spectra of isotopologues or Franck-Condon "
"factors including Duschinsky rotations. This requires a representation of "
"the potential energy surface by polynomials. Different versions of the "
"``PESTRANS`` program will be used in combination with the ``XSURF`` program."
" For further details see:"
msgstr ""
"``PESTRANS`` "
"程序允许通过杜辛斯基类变换来改变势能表示中所使用的坐标系。这使得能够变换势能面，以满足计算同位素体的振动光谱或包含杜辛斯基旋转的弗兰克-"
"康登因子的需要。这要求势能面由多项式表示。不同版本的 ``PESTRANS`` 程序将与 ``XSURF`` 程序结合使用。更多细节请参阅："

msgid ""
"``TRANSTYPE=QFF`` transforms an n-mode expansion of the PES into a quartic "
"force field (QFF)."
msgstr "``TRANSTYPE=QFF`` 将 PES 的 n 模展开转换为四次力场（QFF）。"

msgid ""
"``TRANSTYPE=ISO`` indicates a transformation of the spanning axes of the PES"
" for the calculation of isotopologues."
msgstr "``TRANSTYPE=ISO`` 表示对 PES 的生成轴进行变换，用于计算同位素变体。"

msgid ""
"``TRANSTYPE=FCF`` performs a Duschinsky transformation as needed for the "
"calculation of Franck-Condon factors."
msgstr "``TRANSTYPE=FCF`` 执行 Duschinsky 变换，用于计算弗兰克-康登因子。"

msgid ""
"Most options and directives of the ``XSURF`` program can also be used in the"
" ``PESTRANS`` program (i.e. ``INFO``, ``INTENSITY``, ``SCALNM``, ``DISK``, "
"``LINCOMB``, ``VTAYLOR``), while specific ones had to be excluded (i.e. "
"``NGRID``, etc. )."
msgstr ""
"``XSURF`` 程序的大多数选项和指令也可以在 ``PESTRANS`` 程序中使用（例如 ``INFO``\\ 、\\ "
"``INTENSITY``\\ 、\\ ``SCALNM``\\ 、\\ ``DISK``\\ 、\\ ``LINCOMB``\\ 、\\ "
"``VTAYLOR``\\ ），而某些特定指令则被排除在外（例如 ``NGRID`` 等）。"

msgid "Definition of atomic masses"
msgstr "原子质量的定义"

msgid ""
"Once the ``PESTRANS`` program will be used for the calculation of "
"isotopologues, the atomic masses of the individual atoms can be specified by"
" this directive. Note, the use of the ``MASS`` directive here differs from "
"that in the electronic structure code as it requests the running number of "
"the atoms in the geometry definition."
msgstr ""
"当 ``PESTRANS`` 程序将用于计算同位素体时，可以通过此指令指定各个原子的原子质量。请注意，此处 ``MASS`` "
"指令的用法与电子结构代码中的不同，因为它要求的是几何定义中原子的运行编号。"

msgid "Restart capabilities"
msgstr "重启功能"

msgid ""
"The ``DISK`` directive essentially is the same as in the ``XSURF`` program, "
"i.e. a transformed surface can be dumped or a restart can be performed from "
"an external file."
msgstr "``DISK`` 指令本质上与 ``XSURF`` 程序中的相同，即可以转储变换后的势能面，或者可以从外部文件执行重启。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows a standard calculation for water, the VSCF and "
"VCI calculations after the call of the ``PESTRANS`` program refer a to "
"doubly deuterated water."
msgstr "以下示例展示了水的标准计算，在调用 ``PESTRANS`` 程序后进行的 VSCF 和 VCI 计算参考了双氘代水。"

msgid "``POLY,options [poly]``"
msgstr "``POLY,options [poly]``"

msgid ""
"B. Ziegler, G. Rauhut, *Efficient generation of sum-of-products "
"representations of high-dimensional potential energy surfaces based on "
"multimode expansions.*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4943985>`__ **144**, 114114 (2016) The "
"following *options* are available:"
msgstr ""
"B. Ziegler, G. Rauhut, *Efficient generation of sum-of-products "
"representations of high-dimensional potential energy surfaces based on "
"multimode expansions.*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4943985>`__ **144**, 114114 (2016) The "
"following *options* are available:"

msgid ""
"**``CHI_AV_xD``\\ =\\ *value*** (x=1..3 default=1.d-10; x=4 default=1.d-5) "
"Threshold for the average least squares criterion to be met for the "
"individual orders of the potential."
msgstr ""
"**``CHI_AV_xD``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （x=1..3 默认=1.d-10；x=4 "
"默认=1.d-5）势能各阶次所需满足的平均最小二乘判据的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``CHI_MAX_xD``\\ =\\ *value*** (x=1 default=1.d-10; x=2 default=1.d-8, x=3"
" default=1.d-6, x=4 default=1.d-5) Threshold for the maximum least squares "
"criterion to be met for the individual orders of the potential."
msgstr ""
"**``CHI_MAX_xD``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （x=1 默认=1.d-10；x=2 默认=1.d-8，x=3 "
"默认=1.d-6，x=4 默认=1.d-5）势能各阶次所需满足的最大最小二乘判据的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``DELAUTO``\\ =\\ *value*** In order to delete troublesome 2D, 3D or 4D "
"surfaces from the multi-mode expansion of the potential, the ``DELAUTO`` "
"keyword sets all coefficients of the polynomial expansion of these surfaces "
"to zero. The threshold passed to the ``DELAUTO`` keyword corresponds to the "
":math:`\\chi^2` value of the least squares fitting procedure. It acts on "
"both, the energy and the dipole surfaces. The default is set to 9.d99, i.e. "
"all surfaces with :math:`\\chi^2` values below this threshold will not be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"**``DELAUTO``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 为了从势能的多模展开中删除有问题的 2D、3D 或 4D 曲面，\\ "
"``DELAUTO`` 关键字将这些曲面的多项式展开的所有系数置零。传递给 ``DELAUTO`` 关键字的阈值对应于最小二乘拟合过程的 "
":math:`\\chi^2` 值。它同时作用于能量曲面和偶极矩曲面。默认值设为 9.d99，即所有 :math:`\\chi^2` "
"值低于该阈值的曲面都不会受到影响。"

msgid ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *n*** ``INFO=1`` provides a list of the values of all "
"relevant program parameters (options)."
msgstr "**``INFO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``INFO=1`` 会提供所有相关程序参数（选项）的取值列表。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXBF``\\ =\\ *n*** This keyword controls the maximum number of basis "
"functions to be used. This keyword may be used to restrict the basis for "
"certain purposes."
msgstr "**``MAXBF``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 该关键字控制所使用的基函数的最大数目。该关键字可用于为某些目的限制基函数。"

msgid ""
"**``MINBF``\\ =\\ *n*** (=7 Default) This keyword controls the minimum "
"number of basis functions to be used."
msgstr "**``MINBF``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认=7）该关键字控制所使用的基函数的最小数目。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** The keyword ``NDIM=n`` terminates the transformation "
"after the :math:`n`\\ D terms within the :math:`n`-mode expansion of the "
"surfaces. The default is set to 3. The transformation of the 4D terms can be"
" very time consuming."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 关键字 ``NDIM=n`` 使得变换在曲面的 :math:`n` 模展开中的 "
":math:`n`\\ D 项之后终止。默认值设为 3。4D 项的变换可能非常耗时。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of "
"the dipole surfaces are truncated. The default is set to 3. Note that "
"``NDIMDIP`` has to be lower or equal than ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 偶极矩曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开被截断的项。默认值设为 3。注意 "
"``NDIMDIP`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of "
"the polarizability tensor surfaces are truncated. The default is 0. "
"``NDIMPOL`` has to be lower or equal than ``NDIM`` and must be smaller than "
"4."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 极化率张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开被截断的项。默认为 0。\\ "
"``NDIMPOL`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM`` 且必须小于 4。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of"
" the quadrupole tensor surfaces are truncated. The default is 0. "
"``NDIMQUAD`` has to be lower or equal than ``NDIM`` and must be smaller than"
" 4."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 四极矩张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开被截断的项。默认为 0。\\ "
"``NDIMQUAD`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM`` 且必须小于 4。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMMU``\\ =\\ *n*** An n-mode expansion of the :math:`\\mu`-tensor will"
" be generated and transformed to polynomials up to 3rd order (default). The "
"order can be changed by the integer passed to the ``NDIMMU`` keyword."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMMU``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 将生成 :math:`\\mu` 张量的 n "
"模展开，并变换为最高三阶（默认）的多项式。阶次可通过传递给 ``NDIMMU`` 关键字的整数进行更改。"

msgid ""
"**``PSUM``\\ =\\ *n*** Maximum number of basis functions to be used within "
"the fits of the surfaces (sum of exponents)."
msgstr "**``PSUM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 在曲面拟合中所使用的基函数的最大数目（指数之和）。"

msgid ""
"**``SHOW``\\ =\\ *n*** The coefficients of the polynomial representation can"
" be printed. In order to identify quartic potentials, it is recommended to "
"use ``SHOW=1``. Higher values will lead to very long output files."
msgstr ""
"**``SHOW``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 可以打印多项式表示的系数。为了识别四次势能，建议使用 ``SHOW=1``\\ "
"。更高的值将导致输出文件非常长。"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *variable*** Once polynomials have been generated, the "
"expansion of the potential can be restricted to the harmonic approximation "
"or a semi-quartic force field, i.e. ``TYPE=HARM`` or ``TYPE=QFF``."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 一旦生成了多项式，势能的展开可限制为谐波近似或准四次力场，即 "
"``TYPE=HARM`` 或 ``TYPE=QFF``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``VAM``\\ =\\ *n*** The Watson correction term, i.e. ``VAM=1``, is "
"absorbed in the potential by default. Once the polynomials to be generated "
"should exclude this correction, this needs to be specified by ``VAM=0``. Any"
" other values, i.e. 2 or 3, will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"**``VAM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** Watson 校正项，即 ``VAM=1``\\ "
"，默认被吸收到势能中。若生成的多项式应排除该校正，则需要通过 ``VAM=0`` 指定。任何其他值，即 2 或 3，将被忽略。"

msgid "``DISK,options``"
msgstr "``DISK,options``"

msgid ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n*** Rather than using the options ``START`` and ``SAVE`` "
"one may simply assign a label *n* to a a certain PES and all the records "
"will be set automatically. The grid information is read from the last PES "
"specified in the call of the ``XSURF`` program."
msgstr ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 无需使用 ``START`` 和 ``SAVE`` 选项，只需为某个 PES 指定一个标签 *\\ "
"n*，所有记录都将被自动设置。网格信息从 ``XSURF`` 程序调用中最后指定的 PES 读取。"

msgid "``FIT,options``"
msgstr "``FIT,options``"

msgid ""
"**``COORD(x)``\\ =\\ *variable*** Defines the fit function for coordinate "
":math:`x`. The possible fit functions are B-splines (*bspline*), Gaussian "
"functions (*gauss*), Morse functions (*morse*), polynomials (*poly*) and "
"trigonometric functions (*trigo*)."
msgstr ""
"**``COORD(x)``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 定义坐标 :math:`x` 的拟合函数。可用的拟合函数有 B 样条（*\\ "
"bspline\\ *）、高斯函数（*\\ gauss\\ *）、Morse 函数（*\\ morse\\ *）、多项式（*\\ poly\\ "
"*）和三角函数（*\\ trigo*）。"

msgid ""
"<!--  \\* **``FITLABEL``\\ =\\ *variable*** The name of the label defined in"
" the input stream. The label contains the electronic structure level which "
"should be used for the cross-validation."
msgstr ""
"<!--  \\* **``FITLABEL``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** "
"在输入流中定义的标签名称。该标签包含应当用于交叉验证的电子结构级别。"

msgid ""
"**``FITMETHOD``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) Within the iterative build-up of "
"the individual subsurfaces, intermediate fitting will be used. This can be "
"based on true multidimensional Kronecker product fitting (``FITMETHOD``\\ "
"=1) or on fitting along one-dimensional cuts (``FITMETHOD``\\ =2)."
msgstr ""
"**``FITMETHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认=1）在各子曲面的迭代构建过程中，将使用中间拟合。这可基于真正的多维 "
"Kronecker 积拟合（\\ ``FITMETHOD``\\ =1）或基于沿一维切片的拟合（\\ ``FITMETHOD``\\ =2）。"

msgid ""
"**``FITxD``\\ =\\ *n*** The maximum order of the polynomials used for "
"fitting within the iterative interpolation scheme can be controlled by the "
"keywords ``FIT1D, FIT2D, FIT3D, FIT4D``. The default is given by 9. However "
"in certain cases higher values may be necessary, but require an appropriate "
"number of coarse grid points, which can be controlled by ``MIN1D`` etc. (See"
" ``XSURF`` options) -->"
msgstr ""
"**``FITxD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 迭代插值方案中用于拟合的多项式的最大阶次可通过关键字 ``FIT1D, FIT2D, FIT3D,"
" FIT4D`` 控制。默认值为 9。然而在某些情况下可能需要更高的值，但这需要适当数量的粗网格点，可通过 ``MIN1D`` 等控制。（参见 "
"``XSURF`` 选项） -->"

msgid ""
"**``ONLY``\\ =\\ *variable*** Sets one fit function for all coordinates. The"
" possible fit functions are the same as for the option ``COORD``."
msgstr "**``ONLY``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 为所有坐标设置同一个拟合函数。可用的拟合函数与选项 ``COORD`` 相同。"

msgid "``PSCAL,options``"
msgstr "``PSCAL,options``"

msgid ""
"**``MODE``\\ =\\ *n*** This is a mandatory information, which determines the"
" mode to be scaled."
msgstr "**``MODE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 这是必需的信息，用于确定要标度的模式。"

msgid ""
"**``SFAC``\\ =\\ *value*** Scaling factor to be used for the respective "
"mode."
msgstr "**``SFAC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于相应模式的标度因子。"

msgid "<!--"
msgstr "<!--"

msgid "``INTC,options`` !!!Only Beta!!!"
msgstr "``INTC,options`` !!!仅 Beta 版!!!"

msgid "**``NDIMGMAT``\\ =\\ *n*** Sets the expansion of the G-Matrix."
msgstr "**``NDIMGMAT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 设置 G 矩阵的展开。"

msgid "**``NDIMVG``\\ =\\ *n*** Sets the expansion of the pseudopotential."
msgstr "**``NDIMVG``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 设置赝势的展开。"

msgid "-->"
msgstr "-->"

msgid "``PESTRANS,options [pestrans]``"
msgstr "``PESTRANS,options [pestrans]``"

msgid ""
"Meier, D. Oschetzki, R. Berger, G. Rauhut, *Transformation of potential "
"energy surfaces for estimating isotopic shifts in anharmonic vibrational "
"frequency calculations*, J. Chem. Phys. **140**, 184111 (2014)."
msgstr ""
"Meier, D. Oschetzki, R. Berger, G. Rauhut, *Transformation of potential "
"energy surfaces for estimating isotopic shifts in anharmonic vibrational "
"frequency calculations*, J. Chem. Phys. **140**, 184111 (2014)."

msgid ""
"**``DVEC``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 Default) This keyword controls the shift vector "
"within the transformation. ``DVEC=0`` sets this vector to zero."
msgstr "**``DVEC``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （=0 默认值）此关键字控制变换中的位移矢量。\\ ``DVEC=0`` 将该矢量设为零。"

msgid ""
"**``ECKART``\\ =\\ *n*** By default the Eckart transformation matrix needed "
"within the ``PESTRANS`` program will be computed explicitly. ``ECKART=0`` "
"replaces the Eckart transformation matrix by a unit matrix."
msgstr ""
"**``ECKART``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 默认情况下，\\ ``PESTRANS`` 程序所需的 Eckart 变换矩阵将被显式计算。\\"
" ``ECKART=0`` 用单位矩阵替换 Eckart 变换矩阵。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** Order of the :math:`n`-mode potential for the "
"transformed potential. The information of the original potential will be "
"taken from the the ``POLY`` calculation. Note, the ``NDIMDIP`` keyword "
"requests the intensity directive."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 变换后势能的 :math:`n` 模式展开阶数。原始势能的信息将取自 ``POLY`` "
"计算。注意，\\ ``NDIMDIP`` 关键字用于请求强度指令。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSMAT``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold controlling the analysis of the "
"**S**-matrix indicating the accuracy of the transformation (default: "
"``THRSMAT=0.3``)."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSMAT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 控制 **\\ S** 矩阵分析的阈值，用于指示变换的精度（默认值：\\ "
"``THRSMAT=0.3``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``THRQ``\\ =\\ *value*** Elements in the displacement vectors below this "
"threshold (default ``THRQ=10^{-8}``) will be neglected within the "
"transformation."
msgstr "**``THRQ``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 位移矢量中低于此阈值（默认 ``THRQ=10^{-8}``\\ ）的元素将在变换中被忽略。"

msgid ""
"**``TRANSTYPE``\\ =\\ *variable*** specifies the transformation to be "
"performed by ``PESTRANS``. The default is generated automatically based on "
"the given directives in the input stream."
msgstr ""
"**``TRANSTYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 指定要由 ``PESTRANS`` "
"执行的变换。默认值根据输入流中给定的指令自动生成。"

msgid ""
"**``RECOMP``\\ =\\ *n*** If :math:`n` is set to one, the energy of a "
"geometry is recomputed as long as the the new elongated geometry exceeds the"
" limits of the internal coordinate surface.-->"
msgstr ""
"**``RECOMP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 如果 :math:`n` "
"设为一，则只要新的拉长几何结构超出内坐标面的限制，就会重新计算该几何结构的能量。-->"

msgid ""
"**``UMAT``\\ =\\ *n*** As needed for Franck-Condon calculations, ``UMAT=1`` "
"defines the linear combinations of the displacement vectors due to "
"Duschinsky rotations, which influences the selection of states in subsequent"
" VCI calculations. The default, ``UMAT=0``, switches off this feature."
msgstr ""
"**``UMAT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 如 Franck-Condon 计算所需，\\ ``UMAT=1`` 定义由 Duschinsky "
"转动引起的位移矢量的线性组合，这会影响后续 VCI 计算中状态的选择。默认值 ``UMAT=0`` 关闭此功能。"

msgid "``MASS,options``"
msgstr "``MASS,options``"

msgid ""
"**``MASS``,\\ *n*,\\ *value*** The :math:`n`\\ th atom is supposed to have "
"the mass *value*."
msgstr "**``MASS``,\\ *\\ n\\ *,\\ *\\ value*** 第 :math:`n` 个原子应具有质量 *\\ value*。"

msgid ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n*** For Franck-Condon calculations this allows to specify"
" the number of the two potential energy surfaces."
msgstr "**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 对于 Franck-Condon 计算，这允许指定两个势能面的编号。"

msgid ""
"**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *file name*** Specifies the name of the ASCII restart file "
"(see the ``XSURF`` program) of the transformed potential to be dumped."
msgstr ""
"**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 指定要转储的变换后势能的 ASCII 重启文件（参见 ``XSURF`` "
"程序）的名称。"

msgid ""
"**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *file name*** Specifies the name of an external ASCII "
"restart file to be used. This may be used to continue the transformation of "
"partly transformed potentials or for reading the header of a restart file in"
" Franck-Condon calculations."
msgstr ""
"**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 指定要使用的外部 ASCII "
"重启文件的名称。这可用于继续部分变换势能的变换，或在 Franck-Condon 计算中读取重启文件的文件头。"

msgid ""
"**``WHERE``\\ =\\ *variable*** In combination with the keywords ``DUMP`` and"
" ``EXTERN`` for an external restart file, the keyword ``WHERE`` specifies "
"the path for the external ASCII file. Two options are available, "
"``WHERE=home`` and ``WHERE=scr``. As the external files can be huge for "
"``XSURF`` calculations, they will be stored on the scratch disk given by the"
" Molpro variable ``$TMPDIR`` by default."
msgstr ""
"**``WHERE``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 与关键字 ``DUMP`` 和 ``EXTERN``\\ "
"（用于外部重启文件）结合使用时，关键字 ``WHERE`` 指定外部 ASCII 文件的路径。有两个选项可用：\\ ``WHERE=home`` 和 "
"``WHERE=scr``\\ 。由于 ``XSURF`` 计算的外部文件可能非常大，默认情况下它们将存储在由 Molpro 变量 "
"``$TMPDIR`` 指定的临时磁盘上。"
